/bseplus/AnnualReport/532553/5325530320.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532553/5325530319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532553/5325530318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532553/5325530317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532553/5325530316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532553/5325530315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532553/5325530314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532553/5325530313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532553/5325530312.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Welspun Enterprises reported a 32% year-on-year revenue growth for Q2 FY27, supported by an asset-light business model that includes the monetization of project stakes. Management maintains its full-year guidance of 10-20% revenue growth and EBITDA margins of 18% plus, expecting a stronger second half. The company is actively pursuing incremental orders of INR 8,000-10,000 crores and continues to focus on capital recycling and disciplined execution across its water and transportation verticals. Welspun Enterprises reported a Q2 FY27 revenue growth of 32% YoY and EBITDA growth of 122% YoY, with H1 FY27 revenue in line with guidance and EBITDA margin above guidance at 32.4%. The company holds a diversified order book of ₹18,708 crore as of September 30, 2026, and maintains a robust balance sheet with cash and cash equivalents of ₹1,432 crore and a net worth of ₹3,581 crore.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company maintains its guidance of 10% to 20% revenue growth and EBITDA margins of 18% plus.","quote":"This keeps us on track and aligned with our stated guidance of 10% to 20% of revenue growth and EBITDA margin of 18% plus.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d9388181-7c61-4a71-864e-6cbefc5b233e.pdf"},{"claim":"Management expects H2 FY27 to be stronger than H1 FY27.","quote":"Looking ahead, we anticipate H2 FY27 to be stronger than H1 FY27, factoring Pune-Shirur receiving appointed date by Q4 FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d9388181-7c61-4a71-864e-6cbefc5b233e.pdf"},{"claim":"Overall, in H1FY27 revenue grew by 11% YoY which is in line with stated guidance.","quote":"Overall, in H1FY27 revenue grew by 11%YoY which is in line with our stated guidance, led by disciplined execution and our focussed capital recycling strategy.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fd5e5a37-c4b1-4e32-ab60-706555d35a6e.pdf"},{"claim":"The EBITDA grew by 53% YoY, with an EBITDA margin of 32.4%, well above guidance.","quote":"The EBITDA grew by 53% YoY, with an EBITDA margin of 32.4%, well above our guidance.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fd5e5a37-c4b1-4e32-ab60-706555d35a6e.pdf"},{"claim":"Management remains confident of delivering on medium-term growth and profitability guidance supported by a diversified order book.","quote":"With a diversified order book of ₹18,708 crore and a healthy pipeline of opportunities across our core segments, we remain confident of delivering on our medium-term growth and profitability guidance.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fd5e5a37-c4b1-4e32-ab60-706555d35a6e.pdf"},{"claim":"Management targets annual growth rates of 15% to 20%.","quote":"But I think we are -- internally, we are targeting the growth rates of 15% to 20% on an annualized basis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf"},{"claim":"For the Pune-Shirur project, revenue recognition of around INR500 crores is expected in the financial year.","quote":"We are expecting a revenue recognition of somewhere around INR500 crores in this financial year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"The company expects to add incremental orders worth INR 8,000 crores to INR 10,000 crores in the current financial year.","quote":"On the order book front, we are working towards the incremental orders worth INR8,000 crores to INR10,000 crores in this financial year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d9388181-7c61-4a71-864e-6cbefc5b233e.pdf"},{"claim":"Opportunities in water treatment plants tracked on the horizon are around INR30,000 crores.","quote":"So the -- currently, what we are tracking in the treatment space are projects in the ranges of about INR30,000 crores, which are on the anvil or in various stages of being developed by the client.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf"},{"claim":"About 40% of the tracked treatment plant opportunities are within Maharashtra and 60% are outside Maharashtra.","quote":"Our estimate of these treatment plants is about -- which are on our horizon is that about 40% of them are within Maharashtra and 60% are outside Maharashtra.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The Dharavi Waste Water Treatment Plant has an expected completion date of July 2027.","quote":"• Expected completion by July 2027","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fd5e5a37-c4b1-4e32-ab60-706555d35a6e.pdf"},{"claim":"The Panjrapur Water Treatment Plant has an expected completion date of April 2031 with approximately 80% physical progress achieved.","quote":"• ~80% physical progress achieved\n• Expected Completion by April 2031","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fd5e5a37-c4b1-4e32-ab60-706555d35a6e.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"The company maintains its EBITDA margin guidance of 18% plus.","quote":"We are absolutely confident of making 18% plus, whether the plus will be 2% or 4%, I don't know at this point in time, and I would not want to comment upon it at this stage.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d9388181-7c61-4a71-864e-6cbefc5b233e.pdf"},{"claim":"Consolidated EBITDA margin for Q2 FY27 stood at 39.5%.","quote":"EBITDA margin 39.5% 23.9% 1564 bps 32.4% 23.9% 852 bps","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fd5e5a37-c4b1-4e32-ab60-706555d35a6e.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA margin for the quarter remained resilient at 22.9%.","quote":"Despite these near-term execution challenges and resulting softer revenue performance, we maintained healthy profitability with EBITDA margins remaining resilient at 22.9% during the quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf"},{"claim":"Welspun Michigan Engineers Limited posted an EBITDA margin of 21.3% for Q1 FY27.","quote":"For Q1 FY27, WMEL posted a revenue of INR179 crores with an EBITDA margin of 21.3%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"As of September 30, 2026, the consolidated order book stood at approximately INR 18,700 crores.","quote":"As of September 30, 2026, our consolidated order book stood at INR18,700 crores, approximately.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d9388181-7c61-4a71-864e-6cbefc5b233e.pdf"},{"claim":"Welspun Michigan Engineers Limited has an order book of INR 2,279 crores.","quote":"As of 30 September 2026, our order book stood at INR2,279 crores, including the INR995 crores from project from DGT or roughly 3 years of revenue at our current run rate.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d9388181-7c61-4a71-864e-6cbefc5b233e.pdf"},{"claim":"WMEL order book was approximately ₹2,279 Cr. as on 30th Sept 2026.","quote":"Order Book* at ~ ₹ 2,279 Cr. as on 30th Sept 2026","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fd5e5a37-c4b1-4e32-ab60-706555d35a6e.pdf"},{"claim":"Consolidated order book as on June 30, 2026, stood at over INR18,700 crores.","quote":"Our consolidated order book as on June 30, 2026, stands at over INR18,700 crores, providing healthy revenue visibility over the next few years.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf"},{"claim":"As of June 30, 2026, WMEL's order book stood at INR2,135 crores.","quote":"As of June 30, 2026, WMEL's order book stood at INR2,135 crores, well diversified across tunnels, pumping stations and rehabilitation projects.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company maintains a strong cash position of over INR 1,400 crores and a net debt to equity ratio of 0.2x.","quote":"We have a healthy cash and a bank balance of INR1,400 crores plus, and our net debt to equity stands at 0.2x.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d9388181-7c61-4a71-864e-6cbefc5b233e.pdf"},{"claim":"The Aunta-Simaria road project divestment involves the transfer of INR 764 crores of debt.","quote":"I think we guided to be in the ranges of about INR200 crores for the equity plus-plus, plus the NCA and the debt will transfer INR764 crores of debt will transfer alongside with it.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d9388181-7c61-4a71-864e-6cbefc5b233e.pdf"},{"claim":"Cash and cash equivalents as at September 30, 2026 stood at ₹1,432 crore and net worth at ₹3,581 crore.","quote":"Our strong performance has further strengthened the Balance Sheet, with cash and cash equivalents of ₹1,432 crore and a net worth of ₹3,581 crore as at September 30, 2026.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fd5e5a37-c4b1-4e32-ab60-706555d35a6e.pdf"},{"claim":"The transaction for the Aunta-Simaria project divestment values the asset at an aggregate enterprise value of approximately INR1,000 crores.","quote":"The proposed transaction values the asset at an aggregate enterprise value of approximately INR1,000 crores, subject to customary adjustments, approvals from NHAI and lenders and the fulfillment of other conditions precedent.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf"},{"claim":"The Aunta-Simaria transaction is expected to reduce around INR800 crores of debt from the balance sheet upon completion.","quote":"Upon completion, this transaction is expected to reduce around INR800 crores of debt from our balance sheet, further strengthening of our financial position and enabling redeployment of capital into future growth opportunities.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Execution at the Bhandup water treatment plant faced temporary disruptions due to debris disposal restrictions and air quality conditions.","quote":"Execution had experienced temporary disruptions due to restrictions on the disposal of the excavated debris and temporary suspension of activities by BMC in view of Mumbai's air quality conditions.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d9388181-7c61-4a71-864e-6cbefc5b233e.pdf"},{"claim":"Supply chain disruptions from ongoing geopolitical developments caused a volatile and uncertain operating environment.","quote":"Firstly, we experienced supply chain disruptions arising from the ongoing geopolitical developments, resulting in a volatile and uncertain operating environment.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf"},{"claim":"Execution across a significant portion of the project portfolio was affected by a temporary construction stoppage in Mumbai lasting several weeks.","quote":"Secondly, execution across a significant portion of our project portfolio was affected by the temporary construction stoppage in Mumbai, which lasted for several weeks.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf"},{"claim":"Labor availability at project sites was impacted by migration related to elections in certain key areas.","quote":"Finally, labor availability at project sites was impacted by migration related to elections in certain key areas.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company expects to achieve first gas production from its Mumbai block in FY29.","quote":"This development is expected to accelerate project development, optimize capital deployment and enhance early revenue visibility, which is targeted in FY29.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d9388181-7c61-4a71-864e-6cbefc5b233e.pdf","timeframe":"FY29"},{"claim":"The Dharavi Wastewater Treatment facility is on track for commissioning by July 2027.","quote":"At the Dharavi Wastewater Treatment facility, which is our 418 MLD multilevel treatment plant remains on track for commissioning by July 2027.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d9388181-7c61-4a71-864e-6cbefc5b233e.pdf","timeframe":"July 2027"},{"claim":"The company expects to receive the appointed date for the Pune-Shirur Road Project by Q4 FY27.","quote":"Financial closure and the receipt of appointed date are expected by Q4 FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d9388181-7c61-4a71-864e-6cbefc5b233e.pdf","timeframe":"Q4 FY27"},{"claim":"Dharavi Waste Water Treatment Plant is expected to complete by July 2027.","quote":"• Expected completion by July 2027","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fd5e5a37-c4b1-4e32-ab60-706555d35a6e.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"Panjrapur Water Treatment Plant is expected to complete by April 2031.","quote":"• Expected Completion by April 2031","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fd5e5a37-c4b1-4e32-ab60-706555d35a6e.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The transaction for the divestment of the Aunta-Simaria HAM project is expected to be completed during Q2 FY27.","quote":"We expect to complete the transaction during Q2 FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf","timeframe":"Q2 FY27"},{"claim":"The Sattanathapuram-Nagapattinam Road project is progressing for achieving PCC in Q3 of FY27.","quote":"The Sattanathapuram-Nagapattinam Road project is in advanced stages of completion and progressing for achieving PCC in Q3 of FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf","timeframe":"Q3 of FY27"},{"claim":"Implementation of the S2P platform is expected to go live in Q3 FY27.","quote":"Implementation of our supply chain management Source-to-Pay (S2P) platform is progressing well and expected to go live in Q3 FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c4acbc94-ad38-46d8-8eaa-8c671fc2bf58.pdf","timeframe":"Q3 FY27"},{"claim":"The appointed date for the Pune-Shirur projec